{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261027/photo/bkn-20261027065328981-1027_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261027102109\"/><p>私家車車頭損毀。</p><p>沙田發生交通意外。今日(27日)凌晨5時31分，一輛私家車沿大老山隧道公路向大埔方向行駛，至太古汽水廠時失事，撞向路中分隔石壆，繼而打白鴿轉掉頭停於路中，車頭損毀，右前輪飛脫。途經駕駛人士恐司機受傷被困代為報案，救援人員接報到場前，司機已自行爬出車外，並離開現場。意外中，無人受傷。警員正追查司機下落及調查意外原因。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-27T02:41:54.481978+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":175,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-26T22:53:28+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-27T11:58:19.286647+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-27T02:38:42.187763+00:00","content_hash":"633e63f71dc90902124a11514b1e5a532b7477071515801d6380f0bdcea37859","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-27T02:41:54.481978+00:00","latest_fallback":"minimal","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}